  domainLabel: "SEBI Regulations",
  title: "SEBI (PIT) Insider Trading Compliance and the Structured Digital Database: Regulations 3(5), 3(6), 7 and 9",
  summary: "How a listed company, its designated persons and its fiduciaries must handle unpublished price sensitive information: SDD design, UPSI logs, trading window, pre-clearance, trading plans, disclosures and the code of conduct.",
  author: "Authored by Vipin",
