<p>After the 18 June disclosure, the counter resets and the next 2% change is measured from that disclosure. Practitioners differ on whether purchases and sales should be netted or aggregated; the conservative approach shown above aggregates gross changes. Where the holder and persons acting in concert cross 25% at any point, Regulation 3(1) is triggered and the open offer process starts immediately.</p>

